<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1164_3797.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbeürlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grueß</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">djenst</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>zuvor. Fürsichtigen, ersamen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weysen</unclear>, besonders
<lb n="3"/>lieben und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>. Wir haben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jetz</unclear>-
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">igem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßerm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kirchweih</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jarmarckt</unclear>, ettliche argk-
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wönige</unclear> personen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fencklichen</unclear> einziehen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>,
<lb n="6"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiewol</unclear> wir sy, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">güetlich</unclear> und peinlich, irer
<lb n="7"/>sachen halber examinieren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">könden</unclear> wir
<lb n="8"/>doch noch bißhero kain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grundtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vergicht</unclear> von inen
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekomen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dweil</unclear> dann ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neülicher</unclear> zeiten
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> ettliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">übeltätter</unclear> richten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernemen</unclear>, noch mer irer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bösen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesellschafft</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>angeben, damit dann wir mit ermelten
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> gefangnen die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebür</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßtobas</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürnemen</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>mögint, und dz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">übel</unclear> gestrafft werde, so gelangt
<lb n="15"/>an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbeürlich</unclear> bitten und begeren,
<lb n="16"/>ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllendt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> bey zaigern diß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßerm</unclear> abge-
<lb n="17"/>sanndten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">potten</unclear>. obgedachter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">übeltätter</unclear>, die bey
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> gericht worden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vergichten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuekomen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>,
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölchs</unclear> seyen wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hinwiderumb</unclear> jederzeit
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbeürlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zebeschulden</unclear> berait
<lb n="21"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbiütig</unclear>. Datum den <origDate when="1583-09-10" cert="medium" resp="#ner">10 septembris
<lb n="22"/>anno etc. 83</origDate>.
<lb n="23"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-56" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Verwalter der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haubtmanschafft</unclear>,
<lb n="24"/>burgermaister und rath der
<lb n="25"/>statt Costanntz</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1164_3798.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1164_3799.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="26"/>[]
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1164_3800.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="27"/>Den fuersichtigen, ersamen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wysen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> Rath
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> Gallen</orgName>, unsern guoten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpurn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruenden</unclear>.
</p>
